    "verified_answer": "256.2 cm^2",
    "issue": "Raw GT unit m^2 conflicts with the diagram?s cm labels; the computed value is 256.2 cm^2.",
    "reasoning": "Square base side 10 cm and vertical height 6 cm. Face slant height sqrt(6^2+5^2)=sqrt(61). SA=100+4*(1/2*10*sqrt(61))=100+20*sqrt(61)=256.2 cm^2."
